    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 7,
    "title": "Keep a coherent narrative viewpoint",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-narrative-integration-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Keep a coherent narrative viewpoint",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Across a connected account, set the time, keep referents clear, move events forward and report what someone said. An understood repeated subject can be omitted; reported content keeps ordinary Chinese clause order rather than copying English tense changes.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "昨天我去学校找朋友。朋友说他想学中文。后来我们一起看书。",
                "pinyin": "zuótiān wǒ qù xuéxiào zhǎo péngyou 。 péngyou shuō tā xiǎng xué Zhōngwén 。 hòulái wǒmen yīqǐ kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "Yesterday I went to school to find a friend. My friend said he wanted to study Chinese. Later we read together.",
                "audio": "ccf94542ba255d6f9281f29306ab70a8b615929c04d2feaba3bd0c7266b523be"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "当时",
                "pinyin": "dāngshí",
                "meaning": "then; at that time",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "b468671379c4478ff6e48b3cef3aade6c67793a967af00e728f8cbaf481a8716"
              },
              {
                "text": "后来",
